        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bill Barretta, Kristine Sutherland, Robert Louis Stevenson\n- Films: Muppet Treasure Island, Honey, I Shrunk the Kids\n- Roles: Clueless Morgan, Mrs. Thompson, Joyce Summers\n- Television Shows: Buffy the Vampire Slayer\n\nFacts:\n- Honey, I Shrunk the Kids is a 1989 American comic science fiction film.\n- Kristine Sutherland, born Kristine Young on April 17, 1955, is an American actress.\n- Kristine Sutherland played Mrs. Thompson in Honey, I Shrunk the Kids.\n- Muppet Treasure Island is a 1996 American musical adventure comedy film based on Robert Louis Stevenson's Treasure Island.\n- Bill Barretta made his film debut as a principal puppeteer in Muppet Treasure Island in 1996 as Clueless Morgan.\n- Kristine Sutherland is best known for starring as Joyce Summers, Buffy Summers' mother, on Buffy the Vampire Slayer, and she appeared in every season of the show.",
